<p>Alan Musgrave, professor emeritus of philosophy at the University of Otago, died this past January.<span id="more-56997"></span></p>
<p>The following obituary is by <a href="https://www.otago.ac.nz/philosophy/our-people/academic-staff/charles-pigden" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Charles Pigden</a>, professor of philosophy at the University of Otago.</p>
